      "mergeID": "66be0d2f6c7522580d539943",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The latest update has made it so that, by default, you cannot move at all with an action menu open.\n\nEnabling one handed movement allows you to move forwards, but you cannot strafe, since the X axis now makes you rotate.\n\nThis is a regression; it should be possible to strafe while using an avatar menu. It is not possible to solve this by changing your controller bindings -- in the \"one_hand\" action set, the joystick position can only provide input to the \"move_rotate\" action. There isn't an option to use the \"move\" action.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "It is no longer possible to strafe with an action menu open.",
